      "en": "I am a student.",
      "uz": "Men talabaman."
     },
     {
      "en": "It is a red book.",
      "uz": "Bu qizil kitob."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "title": "Qisqartmalar (Contractions)",
    "text": "Kundalik nutqda to be fe'li egalar bilan qo'shilib qisqartiriladi: I am -> I'm, you are -> you're, it is -> it's, what is -> what's.",
